{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2021-08-25 06:30:00', 'title': 'BROADRIDGE STUDY: 2 IN 3 MILLENNIALS LIKELY TO BEGIN WORKING WITH FAS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, AUG. 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AN OVERWHELMING MAJORITY (96%) OF INVESTORS WHO WORK WITH A FINANCIAL ADVISOR ARE SATISFIED (VERY OR SOMEWHAT) WITH THEIR ADVISOR, ACCORDING TO A NEW SURVEY OF 1,000 U.S. INVESTORS RELEASED TODAY FROM BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC.\xa0(NYSE: BR), A GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER. OF THOSE WHO DO NOT WORK WITH A FINANCIAL ADVISOR, 44% OF ALL INVESTORS AND 65% OF THE MILLENNIAL INVESTORS SAY THAT THEY ARE LIKELY (VERY OR SOMEWHAT) TO BEGIN WORKING WITH AN ADVISOR OVER THE NEXT TWO YEARS.'}